00:09:42.040 --> 00:09:46.270
Now, even though my imaginary
version of Bill's Grocer

00:09:46.270 --> 00:09:49.120
is now a very large
chain, because they

00:09:49.120 --> 00:09:52.480
want to retain the
small-town local grocer feel,

00:09:52.480 --> 00:09:54.520
Bill's Grocer wants
to still continue

00:09:54.520 --> 00:09:57.130
to maintain that close
customer relationship

00:09:57.130 --> 00:09:59.800
and thereby understand
customer feedback

00:09:59.800 --> 00:10:01.930
through various
different means, but also

00:10:01.930 --> 00:10:03.410
be able to scale that as well.

00:10:03.410 --> 00:10:05.380
So in my imaginary
scenario, we're

00:10:05.380 --> 00:10:08.850
