processing scenario.

00:10:15.544 --> 00:10:16.960
So in terms of our
solution goals,

00:10:16.960 --> 00:10:20.560
I think William alluded
to a lot of the things

00:10:20.560 --> 00:10:23.350
and characteristics that
you should try and find

00:10:23.350 --> 00:10:24.520
within a data platform.

00:10:24.520 --> 00:10:27.170
And we'll try and encompass
this within our solution today.

00:10:27.170 --> 00:10:30.630
So even though Bill's
Grocer, from a small business

00:10:30.630 --> 00:10:32.980
through to my large
imaginary business--

00:10:32.980 --> 00:10:35.140
whatever the size,
Bill's Grocer should not

00:10:35.140 --> 00:10:37.570
