store data at scale,

00:10:52.540 --> 00:10:56.270
but to be able to convert the
data into an insight quickly.

00:10:56.270 --> 00:10:57.940
One of the ways that
we'll do this today

00:10:57.940 --> 00:11:00.100
is to incorporate
streaming analytics

00:11:00.100 --> 00:11:04.600
into our different scenarios and
show how you can convert data

00:11:04.600 --> 00:11:07.840
into different insights that
can benefit the business as

00:11:07.840 --> 00:11:10.359
quickly as possible.

00:11:10.359 --> 00:11:12.400
Doing lots of advance
queries to generate insight

00:11:12.400 --> 00:11:14.607
is only one part
of the equation.

00:11:14.607 --> 00:11:16.940
Another part of the equation
is how people will actually

00:11:16.940 --> 00:11:19.610
