00:46:59.190 --> 00:46:59.960
and then charging for six.

00:46:59.960 --> 00:47:00.919
REZA ROKNI: [LAUGHS]

00:47:00.919 --> 00:47:03.460
WIN WOO: I think I'm getting
the short end of the stick here.

00:47:03.460 --> 00:47:04.121
Yup.

00:47:04.121 --> 00:47:04.620
Great.

00:47:04.620 --> 00:47:05.260
REZA ROKNI: OK.

00:47:05.260 --> 00:47:05.760
WIN WOO: OK.

00:47:05.760 --> 00:47:06.259
All right.

00:47:06.259 --> 00:47:10.410
So someone is obviously a big
fan of these chocolate biscuits

00:47:10.410 --> 00:47:12.930
original, of which I'm
only getting one packet.

00:47:12.930 --> 00:47:15.070
But what this is doing
is sending the invoice

00:47:15.070 --> 00:47:18.600
as one Pub/Sub payload
into our pipeline,

00:47:18.600 --> 00:47:20.340
and then via the
streaming aggregation

00:47:20.340 --> 00:47:22.890
that's being applied
to the streaming data,

00:47:22.890 --> 00:47:25.530
we should see an alert
come up to say that there's

00:47:25.530 --> 00:47:29.940
a potential stock alert that
has now happened in the Penrith

00:47:29.940 --> 00:47:31.389
store in New South Wales.

00:47:31.389 --> 00:47:33.680
And so you see, up on the
screen-- or hopefully there--

00:47:33.680 --> 00:47:36.029
that there's a stock alert
for that particular product.

00:47:36.029 --> 00:47:38.070
So this is an example of
some operational insight

00:47:38.070 --> 00:47:40.590
that you can get
from streaming data,

00:47:40.590 --> 00:47:44.070
not just things that are
written out to a BigQuery table.

00:47:44.070 --> 00:47:46.570
So there's different ways that
we can operationalize insight

00:47:46.570 --> 00:47:48.790
that happens in real
time as well as for later

00:47:48.790 --> 00:47:50.380
downstream analysis.

00:47:50.380 --> 00:47:52.056
So with that, I'll
pass back to William.

00:47:52.056 --> 00:47:53.680
And I'll also press
the button for you.

00:47:53.680 --> 00:47:54.640
WILLIAM VAMBENEPE: All right.

00:47:54.640 --> 00:47:55.140
Thank you.

00:47:55.140 --> 00:47:55.980
So now we can eat.

00:47:55.980 --> 00:47:57.449
We're done with the props?

00:47:57.449 --> 00:47:58.490
We can start eating them?

